@startuml
!theme plain
title 共乘與代買明細管理系統 - 技術架構圖

actor "使用者(手機/電腦瀏覽器)" as User

package "Flask 應用程式" {
  component [app.py\n(路由層)] as AppPy
  component [services.py\n(業務邏輯)] as Services
  component [models.py\n(SQLAlchemy 模型)] as Models
  component [database.py\n(DB 連線管理)] as DatabasePy
  component [Jinja2 HTML Templates] as Templates
}

database "SQLite\ncarpool_purchase.db" as SQLite

User --> AppPy : HTTP 請求 (GET/POST)
AppPy --> Templates : 渲染頁面
Templates --> User : HTML 回應

AppPy --> Services : 呼叫業務邏輯
Services --> Models : 操作 ORM 物件
Models --> DatabasePy : 透過 Session 存取
DatabasePy --> SQLite : 讀寫資料

note right of Models
  Member
  CarpoolRecord
  PurchaseRecord
  PurchaseItem
  PurchaseShare
end note

@enduml
